{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgAou4JNfhNkwTrUXJTnt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The soft 404s come from `robots.txt` blocking the API that supplies each note's content. I fixed the robots rule and the error handling in `app.js`, and wrote the cause and fix to `ANSWER.md`.\n\n**Cause:** Note pages are a client-side app. `/n/<slug>` serves an empty HTML shell, and `app.js` fetches the note from `/v1/notes/<slug>`. On 2026-09-07, `robots.txt` got `Disallow: /v1/`, which also stops Googlebot from fetching the API. The fetch fails, and the `catch` block renders \"NOT FOUND\" with HTTP 200. That is a soft 404. Browsers are unaffected because robots.txt only applies to crawlers. The Search Console data matches: notes last crawled before 09-07 are indexed, and every note crawled after is a soft 404.\n\n**Changes made:**\n- `site/robots.txt`: removed the blanket `Disallow: /v1/`. It now blocks only `/v1/auth/`, `/v1/me`, and `/v1/notes/*/reactions`.\n- `site/app.js`: a 404 from the API still shows \"NOT FOUND\". Other failures now show \"Couldn't load this page\" and log the error, so API problems are no longer reported as missing notes. `node --check` passes.\n\n**Not done, and why:**\n- **Real 404 status for missing slugs.** CloudFront rewrites every `/n/*` to a 200 shell, so a nonexistent note will still look like a soft 404. Fixing that needs CloudFront or API changes, and the API code isn't in this repo.\n- **Re-indexing and deploy.** I haven't deployed anything or submitted anything to Search Console. Those steps are yours.\n- **Live check.** I verified by reading the code and running a syntax check. I didn't load the site, because the ground rules limit me to this directory.\n- **Home page status.** The home page was also blocked, but the CSV still shows it as \"Indexed\". That status may be stale, so it's worth checking in the next crawl."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1494,"cache_read_input_tokens":29552,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1494},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fb3bdcd4-177e-45d8-a0e1-d52f7649ebfa","uuid":"678293c8-a608-464e-8af0-94bd09354b9b","timestamp":"2026-10-19T02:30:17.788Z","request_id":"req_011CgAou43En4VEmubjzd3bY"}
